menu "Rockchip RKNPU3"
	depends on ARCH_ROCKCHIP

config ROCKCHIP_RKNPU3
	tristate "Rockchip RKNPU3 Support"
	depends on OF
	select DMA_SHARED_BUFFER
	help
	  This driver provides support for Rockchip RKNPU3 (Neural Processing Unit).
	  RKNPU3 is a hardware accelerator for neural network inference on
	  Rockchip RK3572 and similar SoCs.

	  If you have a Rockchip SoC with NPU support and want to use the NPU
	  for AI acceleration, say Y or M here.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module
	  will be called rknpu3.

endmenu
